WORD CONSEQUENCES -- fixed in the plan BEFORE this ran, and unchanged by it
==============================================================================
  No word enters any config from this under any outcome. If the three tests
  favour an object, the next step is identifying the animal FROM THE PIXELS,
  not choosing among BIP39 animal names; if the pixels cannot settle the
  species the result is 'an unidentified form' and no word follows. The
  leopard/Leopold pun is quarantined: a reason for a stricter test, never a
  candidate. The zodiac locator grade stays [TESTED, NEGATIVE for 2 of 10].
